architecture 外側に並ぶ2本の線

group web as 画面 [note: 利用者が触る所]
  box app as アプリ
end

group server as サーバー [note: 要求を受ける所]
  box api as API
  box auth as 認証
  box pay as 支払い
end

group work as 処理 [note: 裏で動く所]
  box sum as 集計
  box mail as メール
  box push as プッシュ通知
end

group store as 保存 [note: 記録を残す所]
  box log as 記録
  box db as データベース
  box backup as 控え
end

step 知らせる
  app -> mail
  app -> log

step 支払いを通す
  api -> push

step 残す
  app -> db

step 控えを取る
  log -> backup
  app -> sum
